{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850790/extras/63a55563f8c385404d358bb438494dc9.poster.avif?t=1766990107\" width=800 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850790/extras/63a55563f8c385404d358bb438494dc9.webm?t=1766990107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850790/extras/63a55563f8c385404d358bb438494dc9.mp4?t=1766990107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>&quot;<i><strong>Victory belongs not to the highest number, but to the one who reads the opponent\u2019s mind.&quot;</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;What you see is only the opponent's number, and the higher number prevails. But the true winner is the one who overturns the game with bluffing and betting.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850790/extras/56871af942e6c953eb8f8636ac54f578.poster.avif?t=1766990107\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850790/extras/56871af942e6c953eb8f8636ac54f578.webm?t=1766990107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850790/extras/56871af942e6c953eb8f8636ac54f578.mp4?t=1766990107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong>  <br><strong>Mind Game \u2013 Trust No One.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay calm. You won\u2019t die immediately. Focus and deduce your own cards. By reading opponents\u2019 cards, you can quickly gauge if you\u2019re at an advantage. An opponent whispers, \u201cYou\u2019ve got a 1, just FOLD!\u201d But is it the truth? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer \u2013 More Fun Together.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological games are at their best with more players. Supports up to 4 players. Find rooms via the online list or join random games. Private rooms are available for secret matches with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spectator Mode \u2013 The Fun Never Ends.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you\u2019re out, the thrill continues. Use the spectator camera to enjoy the game from multiple angles. We promise\u2014it might be even more fun than playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anti-Cheat \u2013 The Tumor of the Game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know cheating kills fun. That\u2019s why we use Easy Anti-Cheat to monitor and block disruptive actions. If it happens, use the kick feature to remove them. Once kicked, they can never rejoin your room.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3850790?t=1766990107","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850790/0417169636784707c14ae9042a3ee8d3e8a93c87/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766990107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850790/609e56833050b3a072e0513b063ba34fc624d5af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766990107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850790/609e56833050b3a072e0513b063ba34fc624d5af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766990107","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description"