990107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong>  <br><strong>Mind Game \u2013 Trust No One.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay calm. You won\u2019t die immediately. Focus and deduce your own cards. By reading opponents\u2019 cards, you can quickly gauge if you\u2019re at an advantage. An opponent whispers, \u201cYou\u2019ve got a 1, just FOLD!\u201d But is it the truth? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer \u2013 More Fun Together.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological games are at their best with more players. Supports up to 4 players. Find rooms via the online list or join random games. Private rooms are available for secret matches with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spectator Mode \u2013 The Fun Never Ends.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you\u2019re out, the thrill continues. Use the spectator camera to enjoy the game from multiple angles. We promise\u2014it might be even more fun than playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anti-Cheat \u2013 The Tumor of the Game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know cheating kills fun. That\u2019s why we use Easy Anti-Cheat to monitor and block disruptive actions. If it happens, use the kick feature to remove them. Once kicked, they can never rejoin your room.</p>","developers":["4S Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850790/47d2f401f93be9607f3c95ee0fa5369b641e65af/header.jpg?t=1766990107","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<s